                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Whilst this is a very simple game (you just need a VR headset, no controllers) I really enjoy it.  Just tried it on my steam frame and it's a little odd in that when streaming from my PC using the wireless adapter it isn't recognised as a VR title and tries to play in 2D (and fails).  I then installed it on my steam frame and besides a confused loadup screen (thought it wasn't going to work) it runs perfectly :-)",
